00:22:06,250 --> 00:22:09,000
There 's nothing in Harjosari . It 's a secluded village .

259
00:22:09,083 --> 00:22:11,750
That 's why . We 're doing research on secluded villages .

260
00:22:12,250 --> 00:22:13,291
I see .

261
00:22:17,250 --> 00:22:18,958
What do you know about the village ?

262
00:22:19,041 --> 00:22:21,041
Not much .

263
00:22:21,125 --> 00:22:24,375
I know about the village because I recently took their village elder home .

264
00:22:24,458 --> 00:22:27,625
The village elder is a puppet master . He was in my town for a performance .

265
00:22:27,708 --> 00:22:29,000
What 's his name ?

266
00:22:29,083 --> 00:22:30,041
Ki Saptadi .

267
00:22:31,250 --> 00:22:32,458
He 's quite well-known .

268
00:22:32,958 --> 00:22:35,708
Why don 't they build a proper road to the village ?

269
00:22:35,791 --> 00:22:38,250
I heard that the village people didn 't want to .

270
00:22:38,333 --> 00:22:39,250
Why ?

271
00:22:39,333 --> 00:22:40,750
I don 't know .

272
00:22:45,708 --> 00:22:47,291
Dini , please take off those sunglasses .

273
00:22:47,375 --> 00:22:48,375
But it 's too sunny .

274
00:22:49,208 --> 00:22:50,333
What 's your plan ?

275
00:22:50,875 --> 00:22:52,833
Miss , where do you want me to drop you off ?

276
00:22:52,916 --> 00:22:55,375
Just drop us off at Ki Saptadi 's , the village elder 's house .

277
00:22:55,458 --> 00:22:56,291
Are you sure ?

278
00:22:56,375 --> 00:22:57,208
Okay .

279
00:22:57,291 --> 00:22:59,500
Well , I don 't think we can find a hotel here .

280
00:23:22,791 --> 00:23:24,500
Are we staying the night in this village ?

281
00:23:24,583 --> 00:23:25,458
I don 't know .

282
00:23:25,541 --> 00:23:28,583
- What do you mean you don 't know ? - Depends on the situation .

283
00:23:28,666 --> 00:23:30,916
We don 't even know if my house still exists .

284
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:32,666
I didn 't ask you to come with me .

285
00:23:32,750 --> 00:23:34,458
Just go home if you want to .

286
00:23:37,458 --> 00:23:38,833
The house is huge .

287
00:23:41,833 --> 00:23:43,125
Do you know whose house that is ?

288
00:23:43,208 --> 00:23:44,958
I don 't know .

289
00:23:45,041 --> 00:23:49,625
I asked Ki Saptadi when we passed the house , but he didn 't say anything .

290
00:23:49,708 --> 00:23:52,375
What a waste , right ? A house that big sitting empty .

291
00:23:52,458 --> 00:23:54,083
It 's better to give it to me .

292
00:23:55,166 --> 00:23:56,000
Giddyap !

293
00:24:17,625 --> 00:24:19,291
All right .

294
00:24:19,875 --> 00:24:20,833
All right .

295
00:24:21,666 --> 00:24:23,125
Do you want me to wait for you ?

296
00:24:23,208 --> 00:24:24,541
No , but thanks a lot .

297
00:24:27,583 --> 00:24:30,958
If you want me to pick you up , call my number .

298
00:24:31,041 --> 00:24:32,208
Thank you .

299
00:24:36,500 --> 00:24:37,500
Thank you .

300
00:24:40,166 --> 00:24:41,666
Let 's go , gorgeous .

301
00:24:48,500 --> 00:24:49,916
We need to come up with a new story .

302
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:51,791
There 's no way we can say we 're students .

303
00:24:51,875 --> 00:24:53,375
- Why not ? - Well ...

304
00:24:53,458 --> 00:24:55,583
What if he asks too many questions about the university ?

305
00:24:55,666 --> 00:24:57,291
I don 't know anything . Do you ?

306
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,708
Just don 't say we 're students .

307
00:25:02,791 --> 00:25:04,250
- What then ? - Let me think .

308
00:25:04,333 --> 00:25:05,583
Who are you looking for ?

309
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:09,208
We are university students , ma 'am . Can we meet Ki Saptadi ?

310
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:13,208
What for ?

311
00:25:14,958 --> 00:25:17,375
We are writing a book on puppet masters .

312
00:25:17,458 --> 00:25:20,083
We heard Ki Saptadi is a famous puppet master .

313
00:25:24,833 --> 00:25:27,333
He isn 't home . He 'll be back late at night .

314
00:25:27,875 --> 00:25:29,875
You can come back here tomorrow morning .

315
00:25:30,708 --> 00:25:32,291
We 'll come back tomorrow then .

316
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:37,791
Should we call the horse driver to take us back ?

317
00:25:38,291 --> 00:25:42,333
And return here tomorrow ? What a hassle .

318
00:25:58,458 --> 00:26:02,083
There 's a pathway . I think someone must come here often .

319
00:26:02,166 --> 00:26:06,291
That has to stop . We 'll have to make a huge sign saying , " Do Not Enter ! "

320
00:26:08,291 --> 00:26:09,833
Dini , it 's so huge .

321
00:26:09,916 --> 00:26:11,125
Yes , it 's really huge .

322
00:26:46,500 --> 00:26:48,083
How long has it been abandoned ?

323
00:26:48,875 --> 00:26:49,958
I don 't know .

324
00:26:50,458 --> 00:26:52,458
How old were you when you moved to the city ?

325
00:26:53,666 --> 00:26:55,833
According to my aunt , when I was five years old .

326
00:26:55,916 --> 00:26:57,166
And you 're 25 now ?

327
00:26:58,333 --> 00:27:00,125
So it has been empty for 20 years .

328
00:27:20,166 --> 00:27:21,000
Who is that ?

329
00:27:22,458 --> 00:27:23,916
I don 't know .

330
00:27:35,833 --> 00:27:37,541
It seems this house was abandoned in a hurry .

331
00:27:38,041 --> 00:27:39,000
What do you mean ?

332
00:27:39,500 --> 00:27:41,375
All the furniture is still here .

333
00:28:33,375 --> 00:28:34,583
Yes ! This still works .

334
00:28:40,083 --> 00:28:41,083
Where are you going ?

335
00:28:41,708 --> 00:28:44,791
To check the most important place in a house .

336
00:29:05,375 --> 00:29:07,500
We 'll have to do lots of pumping tonight .

337
00:30:12,416 --> 00:30:13,250
This is crazy , Maya !

338
00:30:13,333 --> 00:30:18,708
This house and the land may be as big as 900 square meters !

339
00:30:18,791 --> 00:30:20,875
Imagine how much money you 'd get if you sell it .

340
00:30:20,958 --> 00:30:22,708
What are you doing ?

341
00:30:24,166 --> 00:30:26,333
I found it in the drawer , still wrapped in a plastic bag .

342
00:30:26,958 --> 00:30:28,708
Did your aunt keep any of the documents ?

343
00:30:29,666 --> 00:30:30,916
Not that I know of .

344
00:30:33,291 --> 00:30:36,208
I bet your dad also owned properties in other places .

345
00:30:36,750 --> 00:30:38,375
We have to reclaim that property too .

346
00:30:39,041 --> 00:30:40,916
This is crazy . You can be rich !

347
00:30:41,541 --> 00:30:42,791
Don 't forget me , okay ?

348
00:30:48,291 --> 00:30:50,458
Your parents are gorgeous .

349
00:30:54,708 --> 00:30:55,875
You 're sad , aren 't you ?

350
00:30:57,333 --> 00:30:58,833
No , I just don 't get it .

351
00:30:59,708 --> 00:31:00,541
Why ?

352
00:31:01,416 --> 00:31:04,041
I 'm not in any of these photos ,

353
00:31:04,125 --> 00:31:05,625
only in the photo that I 've shown you .

354
00:31:06,458 --> 00:31:08,416
Maybe they didn 't have a chance to take your photo .

355
00:31:08,500 --> 00:31:11,958
There are piles of photos here . I 'm not in one of them .

356
00:31:13,291 --> 00:31:16,333
Maybe you were an ugly kid ?

357
00:31:20,416 --> 00:31:21,541
Just forget about it .

358
00:31:22,375 --> 00:31:23,250
Okay ?

359
00:31:23,333 --> 00:31:26,625
Maybe they preferred to kiss you rather than take photos of you .

360
00:31:26,708 --> 00:31:27,916
Isn 't that better ?

361
00:31:45,750 --> 00:31:47,833
I think someone just died and was buried .

362
00:31:52,333 --> 00:31:54,083
Are you sure your parents were buried here ?

363
00:31:54,166 --> 00:31:55,416
Where else would they be ?

364
00:31:56,291 --> 00:31:58,500
But you said you think your folks left in a hurry .

365
00:31:58,583 --> 00:32:00,375
You meant they had to leave the village , right ?

366
00:32:02,041 --> 00:32:03,375
You might be right .

367
00:32:03,916 --> 00:32:06,875
Let 's just finish this row , then we go back to the house .

368
00:32:07,375 --> 00:32:08,208
Can we go back now ?

369
00:32:08,791 --> 00:32:12,375
Dini , it 's just dead people . Why are you afraid of the graveyard ?

370
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:15,583
I 'm not scared . I just think it 's pointless .

371
00:32:16,333 --> 00:32:20,041
Dead people should just be cremated . So they won 't take up space like this .

372
00:32:20,125 --> 00:32:22,541
It 's better to turn the land into housing for the living .

373
00:32:22,625 --> 00:32:23,458
Hey .

374
00:32:23,958 --> 00:32:25,625
You have to promise me .

375
00:32:25,708 --> 00:32:30,375
When I die , please cremate my body . And spread my ashes in the sea .

376
00:32:31,375 --> 00:32:34,875
I might get reincarnated as a fish . It 's better than being a human .

377
00:32:34,958 --> 00:32:36,958
You 'll get caught by fishermen and turned into sushi .

378
00:32:37,041 --> 00:32:39,458
I 'll be a shark , and eat humans .

379
00:32:39,541 --> 00:32:40,750
Sharks don 't eat humans .

380
00:32:41,791 --> 00:32:42,958
Unless they 're really hungry .

381
00:32:45,875 --> 00:32:46,708
Dini .

382
00:32:47,708 --> 00:32:48,791
They 're here .

383
00:32:48,875 --> 00:32:51,333
NYAI SHINTA

384
00:32:56,458 --> 00:32:58,000
You 've seen their graves . Now let 's go .

385
00:32:58,083 --> 00:32:59,083
Hold on .

386
00:33:02,666 --> 00:33:04,166
Do you know the prayer for dead people ?

387
00:33:04,916 --> 00:33:05,958
You 're asking me ?

388
00:33:07,958 --> 00:33:11,625
Just say it in Indonesian . You think God only speaks Arabic ?

389
00:33:26,666 --> 00:33:27,791
What did you pray for anyway ?

390
00:33:28,791 --> 00:33:30,583
So that they rest in peace .

391
00:33:32,291 --> 00:33:33,916
Did you pray so you can get their fortune ?

392
00:33:35,750 --> 00:33:36,666
That too .

393
00:33:37,541 --> 00:33:38,416
Good .

394
00:33:50,000 --> 00:33:50,833
Maya .

395
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:54,333
Why are there so many children 's graves ?

396
00:33:56,833 --> 00:34:00,666
Maybe they 're not children , just really tiny graves .

397
00:34:00,750 --> 00:34:02,333
Just look at the dates .

398
00:34:04,125 --> 00:34:06,291
CHILD OF WONSO-TUMINI COUPLE BORN AND DIED JULY 7TH , 2016

399
00:34:06,375 --> 00:34:07,875
They didn 't even have names .

400
00:34:10,291 --> 00:34:11,833
What is up with your village , Maya ?

401
00:34:20,291 --> 00:34:27,291
HARJOSARI VILLAGE CEMETERY

402
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:35,708
CEMETERY COURTESY OF KI DONOWONGSO

403
00:34:35,791 --> 00:34:38,083
It seems that the villagers don 't really like your family .

404
00:35:17,583 --> 00:35:19,125
Dini !

405
00:35:19,208 --> 00:35:20,041
What ?

406
00:35:20,125 --> 00:35:21,250
Did you hear that ?

407
00:35:23,250 --> 00:35:24,208
Yes .

408
00:35:25,291 --> 00:35:26,958
I heard your annoying voice .

409
00:35:27,041 --> 00:35:28,541
I 'm serious !

410
00:35:28,625 --> 00:35:30,916
What do you want ? I 'm so tired , Maya !

411
00:35:31,458 --> 00:35:33,458
How can you sleep in a dusty bed like this ?

412
00:35:33,541 --> 00:35:34,416
Shut up .

413
00:35:34,500 --> 00:35:35,750
- Dini . - Shut up .

414
00:36:41,041 --> 00:36:42,291
Shit .

415
00:37:31,375 --> 00:37:33,833
Dear Almighty .

416
00:37:38,458 --> 00:37:41,416
Give me pain that I can bear .

417
00:39:10,666 --> 00:39:11,625
What are you doing ?

418
00:39:12,125 --> 00:39:13,666
I think someone just died .

419
00:39:14,166 --> 00:39:15,083
Again ?

420
00:39:23,958 --> 00:39:25,416
Maya , what are you doing ?

421
00:39:43,625 --> 00:39:46,041
Within two days , two people have died .

422
00:39:46,625 --> 00:39:48,583
No wonder this village seems empty .

423
00:40:01,583 --> 00:40:02,583
Wait !

424
00:40:03,833 --> 00:40:04,750
What should we do ?

425
00:40:06,000 --> 00:40:06,833
Just be calm .

426
00:40:20,791 --> 00:40:23,000
I heard that you came to my house to see me ?

427
00:40:23,583 --> 00:40:24,625
That 's right , sir .

428
00:40:26,958 --> 00:40:28,625
You 're writing a book about puppet masters ?

429
00:40:29,125 --> 00:40:31,708
For our university , sir . We are university students .

430
00:40:39,458 --> 00:40:41,083
Why did you choose this village ?

431
00:40:42,916 --> 00:40:47,208
We 've visited other villages that are still performing wayang .

432
00:40:47,708 --> 00:40:51,125
Then we heard about you . So we came here .

433
00:40:58,458 --> 00:40:59,708
How old are the both of you ?

434
00:41:00,708 --> 00:41:01,791
We 're 20 years old .

435
00:41:04,666 --> 00:41:08,041
We are very sorry to come during an inconvenient time .

436
00:41:08,125 --> 00:41:09,291
Don 't worry about it .

437
00:41:11,625 --> 00:41:16,125
Come to my house if you want to talk .

438
00:41:18,166 --> 00:41:19,375
Thank you , sir .

439
00:41:24,250 --> 00:41:25,958
We need to leave this village now .

440
00:41:26,041 --> 00:41:26,875
What ?

441
00:41:26,958 --> 00:41:30,125
This place creeps me out . They look like they 're going to eat us alive .

442
00:41:30,208 --> 00:41:31,416
And someone dies here daily .

443
00:41:31,500 --> 00:41:33,416
- It 's just a coincidence . - No way .

444
00:41:33,916 --> 00:41:36,041
If you 're desperate about your inheritance ,

445
00:41:36,125 --> 00:41:38,750
we can send someone to come here and take care of it .

446
00:41:38,833 --> 00:41:41,208
You think we can afford that ?

447
00:41:41,291 --> 00:41:44,583
We 're broke . We can 't even pay rent this month .

448
00:41:44,666 --> 00:41:46,541
We 'll figure something out . We always do .

449
00:41:46,625 --> 00:41:49,625
Look , we 're here now . We just have to stay a little longer .

450
00:41:49,708 --> 00:41:51,208
We may not have to spend another night .

451
00:41:51,291 --> 00:41:54,666
We 'll ask Ki Saptadi if the house actually belongs to my family . Then , we go .

452
00:41:58,541 --> 00:42:00,041
We have to ask him in a gentle manner .

453
00:42:00,125 --> 00:42:01,208
Yes , a very gentle way .

454
00:42:01,291 --> 00:42:03,333
I 'm not sure of this idea .

455
00:42:03,416 --> 00:42:05,375
Come on , Dini . We can do this .

456
00:42:06,083 --> 00:42:08,708
Maya , how are you going to ask him about the house

457
00:42:08,791 --> 00:42:10,875
without revealing that you 're Rahayu ?

458
00:42:10,958 --> 00:42:14,208
It 's risky . Someone tried to kill you , remember ?

459
00:42:14,291 --> 00:42:16,333
And most likely because of the house .

460
00:42:16,875 --> 00:42:20,041
Understood . So let 's just play along as students .

461
00:42:20,125 --> 00:42:22,666
Nobody kills students .

462
00:42:27,750 --> 00:42:29,291
Fine . I 'm going to go back to the house .

463
00:42:29,375 --> 00:42:31,125
I stink like a dead raccoon . I want to shower .

464
00:42:31,708 --> 00:42:33,125
Fine . I 'll find us something to eat .

465
00:42:56,416 --> 00:42:57,375
Excuse me .

466
00:42:58,041 --> 00:42:59,041
Can I buy some food ?

467
00:43:01,916 --> 00:43:04,000
To eat here or to go ?

468
00:43:04,083 --> 00:43:05,750
Two to go , please .

469
00:43:05,833 --> 00:43:10,500
Two rice with egg and vegetables .

470
00:43:13,500 --> 00:43:14,541
Miss .

471
00:43:15,250 --> 00:43:17,541
Do you know anything about that big , abandoned house ?

472
00:43:18,041 --> 00:43:19,291
Do you know who it belongs to ?

473
00:43:20,208 --> 00:43:24,916
A family used to live there when I was still a child .

474
00:43:25,750 --> 00:43:26,625
Who ?

475
00:43:27,500 --> 00:43:29,375
It 's a house of evil .

476
00:43:30,750 --> 00:43:31,958
What did she say ?

477
00:43:33,708 --> 00:43:36,458
It 's full of diseases .

478
00:43:37,750 --> 00:43:40,625
My grandmother said it 's a house of disease .

479
00:43:41,625 --> 00:43:42,500
What does she mean ?

480
00:43:42,583 --> 00:43:46,875
She said the devils used to live there and left a horrendous disease .

481
00:44:26,458 --> 00:44:27,375
Can I help you ?

482
00:44:27,458 --> 00:44:28,291
Excuse me , miss .

483
00:44:28,958 --> 00:44:34,041
We heard that you and your friend spent a night here .

484
00:44:35,000 --> 00:44:36,000
It 's not allowed .

485
00:44:37,166 --> 00:44:40,416
So sorry , we couldn 't find another place .

486
00:44:40,500 --> 00:44:45,166
This old house has been abandoned for a long time .

487
00:44:46,791 --> 00:44:49,541
It 's not safe . The roof might cave in .

488
00:44:50,375 --> 00:44:52,750
I know , thank you for your concern . We 're leaving soon .

489
00:44:52,833 --> 00:44:57,958
I know it 's a pity a house this big is unoccupied .

490
00:44:58,708 --> 00:45:02,958
But it doesn 't belong to us , so we can 't use it .

491
00:45:04,875 --> 00:45:06,125
Who does it belong to ?

492
00:45:07,375 --> 00:45:10,541
The heir of this family . A girl .

493
00:45:11,166 --> 00:45:14,250
Ki Saptadi has all of the documents .

494
00:45:15,375 --> 00:45:18,291
He has been waiting for the girl to claim it ,

495
00:45:18,833 --> 00:45:21,666
so he can give back all of the documents .

496
00:45:21,750 --> 00:45:24,500
So this house will no longer be his responsibility .

497
00:45:28,041 --> 00:45:30,750
Is the girl 's name Rahayu ?

498
00:45:32,791 --> 00:45:34,041
How do you know the name ?

499
00:45:36,083 --> 00:45:37,041
Because ...

500
00:45:39,583 --> 00:45:40,875
I am Rahayu .

501
00:45:47,958 --> 00:45:53,541
Well , Ki Saptadi is about to go

502
00:45:54,041 --> 00:45:55,166
to another village .

503
00:45:55,250 --> 00:46:01,500
If you can meet him now , he can give you the documents .

504
00:46:07,291 --> 00:46:08,958
Where 's your friend ?

505
00:46:09,041 --> 00:46:11,666
She 's getting us something to eat .

506
00:46:11,750 --> 00:46:14,333
She really is a college student . I 'm accompanying her .

507
00:46:18,375 --> 00:46:20,958
Well , it 's up to you .

508
00:46:21,541 --> 00:46:24,166
If you want to wait until Ki Saptadi is back , be my guest .

509
00:46:24,750 --> 00:46:29,125
He 'll return ... in three days .

510
00:46:29,708 --> 00:46:30,708
Three days ?

511
00:46:31,416 --> 00:46:34,708
But earlier today , he told us to come to his house tonight ,

512
00:46:34,791 --> 00:46:37,041
so my friend could ask him some questions for her research .

513
00:46:37,125 --> 00:46:39,083
Yes , that was before .

514
00:46:39,708 --> 00:46:43,208
But he got a sudden invitation to perform in another village .

515
00:46:43,291 --> 00:46:44,458
And it 's quite far from here .

516
00:46:47,375 --> 00:46:50,375
Okay , then . I 'll go meet him now .

517
00:46:51,541 --> 00:46:52,666
We can take you to him .

518
00:46:52,750 --> 00:46:54,583
I know where he lives .

